title: Palo Alto Networks: Power supplies
agents: paloalto_api
catalog: hw/network/paloalto
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-paloalto-api
description:
 Monitors the power supplies reported by "show system environmentals". The
 service is CRIT if the power supply reports an alarm and WARN (configurable)
 if it is not inserted.

item:
 Slot and description of the power supply, e.g. "Slot1 Power Supply #1 (left)".

discovery:
 One service is created per power supply.
